00:54:19.679 --> 00:54:22.204
♪ And there's no end in sight ♪


00:54:22.248 --> 00:54:24.045
♪ And there's ♪


00:54:24.083 --> 00:54:25.380
♪ And there's ♪


00:54:25.418 --> 00:54:27.818
♪ And there's no end in sight ♪


00:54:34.393 --> 00:54:37.453
- We might have a federal charge
if they get picky.


00:54:37.497 --> 00:54:40.364
- Great.
Leavenworth, here we come.


00:54:43.369 --> 00:54:44.700
- An invoice?


00:54:52.612 --> 00:54:55.410
- ♪ Keeping up ♪


00:54:55.448 --> 00:54:56.847
♪ Keeping up ♪


00:54:56.883 --> 00:54:59.317
- Green, green.


00:54:59.352 --> 00:55:02.321
- Ouch, that hurts.


00:55:02.355 --> 00:55:03.515
- ♪ Keeping it up ♪


00:55:03.556 --> 00:55:07.549
♪ Keeping it up ♪


00:55:07.593 --> 00:55:11.256
- Information is essential
so that doctors and patients


00:55:11.297 --> 00:55:13.595
can make intelligent treatment
decisions.


00:55:16.636 --> 00:55:17.762
- Okay, all right.


00:55:17.804 --> 00:55:19.431
Do I have to hold
the red button?


00:55:19.472 --> 00:55:21.667
- No, you can let go, okay.


00:55:21.707 --> 00:55:23.265
- I'm really glad to see
everybody here.


00:55:23.309 --> 00:55:24.435
You look really good.


00:55:26.913 --> 00:55:29.882
- ♪ Try to keep up
in time ♪


00:55:29.916 --> 00:55:32.111
- I'd like to suggest
it would not be unethical


00:55:32.151 --> 00:55:35.678
to do a randomized trial of two
different prevention programs.


00:55:38.758 --> 00:55:40.783
- If we don't eradicate HIV
everywhere,


00:55:40.827 --> 00:55:43.694
we will never eradicate it
anywhere.


00:55:43.729 --> 00:55:46.220
- ♪ Keeping up ♪


00:55:46.265 --> 00:55:48.358
♪ Keeping up ♪


00:55:48.401 --> 00:55:50.301
- We may march
without incident,


00:55:50.336 --> 00:55:52.133
or they may arrest us.


00:55:52.171 --> 00:55:53.934
But it'll be fun.


